### G6. v3.0 Architecture

```
v3.0 Architecture (species + land use awareness):

Input: 64-D AlphaEarth (per year from 8-year stack)
     + 56 continuous env (WorldClim, soil, terrain, hydrology)
     + 5 existing categorical embeddings (JRC, DW, ESA WorldCover, etc.)
     + is_introduced (0/0.5/1)
     + hilda_obs_class (8D embedding)
     + hilda_emb_class (8D embedding)
     + land_state_class (8D embedding, from LSE v1 pseudo-labels)
     ≈ ~200+ input features after embedding

Gate MLP: jrc_emb(3D) + is_introduced(1D) + land_state features
  → alpha in [0,1]

Gated Fusion: alpha * sat + (1-alpha) * env

Linear(256) → ReLU → [ResBlock(256)]×4

Species Head: Linear(N_species) + Planted Logit Boost
Land State Aux Head: Linear(4) → disturbance class (pseudo-labels from LSE v1)

Loss: BCE(species) + 0.1 * CE(land_state)
```

### G7. Training Schedule

| Phase | Epochs | Learning Rate | Loss Weights | Notes |
|-------|--------|---------------|--------------|-------|
| **Warm-up** | 1-3 | 1e-3 | species=1.0, land_state=0.1 | Species head learns first |
| **Joint** | 4-10 | 5e-4 | species=1.0, land_state=0.2 | Both heads training |
| **Fine-tune** | 11-15 | 1e-4 | species=1.0, land_state=0.1 | Reduce LR, species emphasis |

**Hardware**: H100 GPU on GCP (32.3M rows × 15 epochs exceeds MPS memory). Training script: `orchestrator/train_on_gcp.sh` → `orchestrator/train_on_vm.py`.

